    {
      "key": "t36a51d5252bb07d2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Reassess the thesis, monitor spreads, avoid increasing size impulsively and close the trade when the original reason for holding it no longer applies.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
