    {
      "key": "t17ddcd63b84c91df",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Can you trade Apple, Tesla or Nvidia stock CFDs during earnings season?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">您可以在财报季期间交易苹果、特斯拉或英伟达股票差价合约吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t18f434717cd0018f",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stock CFDs may be traded around earnings when the broker offers the instrument and the relevant market is open. Review the availability note in the introduction and confirm current contract hours before ordering.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当经纪商提供该工具并且相关市场开放时，股票差价合约可以围绕收益进行交易。订购前请查看简介中的可用性说明并确认当前合同时间。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6c5b0d5ec4b94688",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Margin depends on the instrument, position size, account and broker rules. Providers may change requirements during unusual volatility, so check the current contract specification.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">保证金取决于工具、头寸规模、账户和经纪商规则。提供商可能会在异常波动期间更改要求，因此请检查当前的合同规范。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3d0e496c37a89bc0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Can you short a stock CFD if you expect bad earnings?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如果您预期收益不佳，可以做空股票差价合约吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1bfdd1ecdbfaa722",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A stock CFD generally permits short positions, subject to availability and conditions. A positive surprise can cause a gap beyond the planned stop-loss.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">股票差价合约通常允许空头头寸，但须视供应情况和条件而定。积极的意外可能会导致超出计划止损的缺口。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1257ec9ebe5b4374",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The CFD may reopen far above or below its previous level. A stop-loss can execute at the next available price, producing a larger-than-planned loss.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">差价合约重新开放可能会远高于或低于之前的水平。止损可以在下一个可用价格执行，从而产生大于计划的损失。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tff724521274feae1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Is a stock CFD the same as owning shares?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">股票差价合约与拥有股票相同吗？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t363118afb828b393",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">No. A CFD provides price exposure but no ownership, voting rights or direct shareholder rights. Cash adjustments may apply under the contract terms.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">没有。差价合约提供价格风险，但不提供所有权、投票权或直接股东权利。现金调整可能会根据合同条款进行。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf7b01bb61caeb3c4",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review [link to UpForex's live Stock CFDs product page confirm exact URL before publishing] and practise the process in a demo environment before considering live exposure. For contract or market-hour questions,</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">contact our support team</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple,-tesla-&-nvidia#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-to-trade-stock-cfds-apple-tesla-nvidia"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">查看[UpForex实时股票差价合约产品页面链接，发布前确认准确URL]，并在考虑真实资金风险敞口前，先在模拟环境中练习流程。有关合约或市场交易时间的问题，请</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"3\">联系我们的支持团队</span></span><span data-i18n-slot=\"4\">。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0175a30019d72eee",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Quick Answer:</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> A stop-loss automatically closes a trade at a chosen price to limit a loss, while a take-profit closes it at a chosen price to secure a gain. Used together, stop-loss and take-profit orders define a trade’s planned risk and potential reward before market movement or emotion affects the decision.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">快速回答：</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">止损会自动以选定的价格平仓以限制损失，而止盈会以选定的价格平仓以确保收益。止损和止盈订单一起使用，可以在市场走势或情绪影响决策之前定义交易的计划风险和潜在回报。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb39004371f176aab",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Stop-Loss Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是止损单？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf52bc68467d0a552",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The simplest </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">stop loss meaning</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\"> is a planned exit for a trade that moves in the wrong direction. For a long position, the stop-loss is normally placed below the entry price. For a short position, it is normally placed above the entry price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">最简单的</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">止损含义</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">是针对错误方向的交易计划退出。对于多头头寸，止损通常设置在入场价格以下。对于空头头寸，通常放置在入场价格之上。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7eeb1df7a1a80edd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Take-Profit Order?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是止盈订单？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfb561c618cfd18e9",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A take-profit is an instruction to close a position automatically when price reaches a predefined profit-taking level.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止盈是当价格达到预定获利水平时自动平仓的指令。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc7903fd5eaac26ad",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">For a long position, the take-profit is normally above the entry price. For a short position, it is normally below the entry price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">对于多头头寸，止盈通常高于入场价格。对于空头头寸，它通常低于入场价格。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t910b796c889aa1c0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stop-Loss vs. Take-Profit</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止损与止盈</span>"
    },
    {
