        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">执行限制</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1300b989724355a7",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is a Trailing Stop-Loss?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是追踪止损？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9c49f35424a83c3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trailing stop-loss automatically moves a stop level in the trade’s favour while maintaining a selected distance from the current price.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">追踪止损会自动将止损水平向有利于交易的方向移动，同时与当前价格保持选定的距离。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3678c6adec877ba3",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Unlike a fixed stop-loss, a trailing stop can follow favourable price movement. If price later reverses, the stop remains at its most recently adjusted level rather than moving farther away.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">与固定止损不同，追踪止损可以跟随有利的价格变动。如果价格随后反转，止损位仍保持在最近调整的水平，而不是移得更远。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t409ec8e566bce757",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Do Stop-Loss and Take-Profit Work Together?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止损和止盈如何协同工作？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tbe952f69dc735957",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A trade risking 50 pips to target 100 pips has a </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">1:2 risk-reward ratio</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">. This does not mean the trade is likely to win or that the reward will be reached. It only measures the planned distance between entry and the two exit levels.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">以 50 点的风险达到目标 100 点的交易具有 </span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">1:2 的风险回报比</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"2\">。这并不意味着交易可能获胜或将获得回报。它仅测量入口和两个出口层之间的计划距离。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t44912769a4a85eff",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How Do You Choose Stop-Loss and Take-Profit Levels?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">如何选择止损和止盈水平？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0f5f0aff32442387",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">There is no universal distance that works for every instrument or strategy. Traders commonly assess:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">没有适用于所有工具或策略的通用距离。交易者通常评估：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tebbe4b6cbd4123cc",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Swing highs and swing lows</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">波动高点和波动低点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "te8f2d5211ab0a3b5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Current volatility</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当前波动</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tf9f6d3daad5fecc2",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Market-session liquidity</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">市场交易时段流动性</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t81b87d9f90b64baf",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Spread and possible slippage</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">点差和可能的滑点</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t266ca414adf5977a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Take-profit levels should also reflect realistic market structure. A target placed beyond major resistance or support may require a move that the current market conditions do not support.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/stop-loss-and-take-profit-risk-management-guide"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">止盈水平还应反映现实的市场结构。超出主要阻力位或支撑位的目标可能需要当前市场状况不支持的走势。</span>"
    }
  ]
}
